OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for extra cells at
OL,4,Avulnerable care unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FAdditional cells for a new vulnerable
OL,7,Fcare unit have been proposed at
OL,8,FJersey's prison, ahead of new laws to
OL,9,Fprotect women and girls.
OL,11,FPoliticians approved a series of laws
OL,12,Foffering more protection for women and
OL,13,Fgirls from violence and domestic abuse.
OL,14,FThe changes include stand-alone
OL,15,Foffences for stalking and non-fatal
OL,16,Fstrangulation.
OL,18,FHome affairs minister, Senator Helen
OL,19,FMiles, said a new care and separation
OL,20,Fbuilding had been proposed with more
OL,21,Fflexible accommodation for prisoners
OL,22,Fwith varying health and other needs.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
