OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for extra cells at
OL,4,Avulnerable care unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiles said it would provide extra
OL,7,Fcapacity to match the "anticipated
OL,8,Fgrowth in demand" from the new
OL,9,Flegislation and other prison population
OL,10,Fpressures.
